        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "True.",
          "worked": "True. The sets are disjoint, so no element is counted twice. By inclusion–exclusion,\n$$\\begin{align*}|A\\cup B|&=|A|+|B|-|A\\cap B|\\\\|A\\cup B|&=|A|+|B|-0\\\\|A\\cup B|&=|A|+|B|.\\end{align*}$$",
